    title: "Yemeni forces say they repelled large-scale Houthi attack in Taiz",
    summary: "Yemeni forces say they repelled large-scale Houthi attack in Taiz Yemeni government forces said they had repelled a large-scale Houthi attack on the al-Aqroud front in the southeast of Taiz governorate, following reports of violent clashes between the two sides in the area, Al Jazeera reported. The report said that clashes had erupted on the front amid air strikes targeting Houthi supply lines and gatherings in al-Shamaitain and al-Maqatirah. The Siege Affairs Office in Taiz said it had documented 44 deaths and 37 injuries over the past 10 days. One person was killed and two others wounded in the past 24 hours, it added. A fighter loyal to Yemen’s internationally recognised government operates a turret from a pickup truck along the frontlines near Mount al-Midan in Taiz province, 26 October 2026 (Ahmad al-Basha/AFP)",
